	"layer": "L1",
	"question": "Origin requests, Worker-invocation equivalents and bytes per device per day, with and without spool, for visitors who return after one lease or more, per engine.",
	"instrument": "Playwright persistent contexts reopened on one profile each day; the wall clock of the server and the browser moved together by libfaketime reading an offset file; every request that reaches the origin handler is counted with its method, path, response bytes, day and view.",
